        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Powered by the production of our scalable multi-chip quantum processors in Fab-1 and our full-stack product development approach, we are working to develop quantum computing systems that demonstrate clear performance advantages over classical computing alternatives for multiple high-impact application areas.",
        "start_character": 8075,
        "end_character": 8384
      },
      {
