        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "See also “Risk Factors— We face significant technical and engineering challenges in completing the development of our quantum computers, producing our quantum computers at scale, achieving our targeted performance milestones, and realizing quantum advantage or LFTQC, any of which if not accomplished would adversely impact our business, financial condition, and results of operations.”",
