        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023454",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our full-stack product development approach, and strategy of forging collaborative customer partnerships positions us to be a highly valued and long-term provider of quantum computing services to these organizations.",
        "start_character": 23663,
        "end_character": 23890
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023454",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023454-08baf1a738b2b5c7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023454",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also developed numerous proprietary technologies required to create quantum computing chips, quantum computer systems, software and cloud-based services and we rigorously protect our unique intellectual property through a portfolio of 121 patents issued and 160 patents pending as of December 31, 2025.",
        "start_character": 18015,
        "end_character": 18325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023454",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023454-08baf1a738b2b5c7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023454",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have formed commercial partnerships with business and government entities that are designed to advance their mutual understanding of the opportunities, challenges, and solutions necessary for quantum computing to excel in specific real-world applications.",
        "start_character": 16997,
        "end_character": 17255
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023454",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023454-08baf1a738b2b5c7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023454",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We leverage our chips through a full-stack product development approach, from quantum chip design and manufacturing through cloud delivery.",
        "start_character": 2401,
        "end_character": 2540
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023454",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023454-08baf1a738b2b5c7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023454",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer our full-stack quantum computing platform as a cloud service to a wide range of end-users, directly through our Rigetti Quantum Cloud Services (QCS®) platform, and also through public cloud service providers.",
        "start_character": 2772,
        "end_character": 2989
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023454",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023454-08baf1a738b2b5c7",
